    "author_avatar": "/assets/images/reviews/pfp-ananya.jpg",
    "content": "Crossing the high passes of Zanskar Valley is an odyssey that transforms how you see the Himalayas. From the monolithic spire of Gonbo Rangjon to the cliffside monastery of Phuktal Gompa, every turn reveals ancient homestays, glacial streams, and legendary hospitality.\n\n Essential Highlights\nGonbo Rangjon Monolith  : Camping under starlit skies near the sacred mountain.\nPhuktal Monastery  : A breathtaking 12th-century structure built into a giant cave cliff.\nShinku La Pass  : Riding across the high altitude motorable pass connection.",
